- Google Fonts (Lora, Noto Sans, Inter, Source Code Pro): OFL-1.1.
- Our World in Data CO2 and energy datasets: CC-BY-4.0.
- ripgrep source: MIT OR Unlicense.
- Khronos glTF-Sample-Assets: FlightHelmet, SheenChair, ToyCar (CC0-1.0);
